{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：10:20 2026-09-17 HKT<br/>發佈時間：10:20 2026-09-17 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：10:20 2026-09-17 HKT</p><p>特首李家超昨日發表香港首份五年規劃及2026年施政報告，他今早10時半到立法會出席行政長官互動交流答問會，向議員解釋政策、回應提問。《星島頭條》直擊重點內容。</p><img alt=\"李家超昨發表五年規劃及施政報告。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/14f4200ee767925822d1e4faaccc8c53/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260916_110734871_07.jpg\"/><img alt=\"李家超昨發表五年規劃及施政報告。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/97dc06df16b3f24975894cf50276eefb/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260916_112657940_1.jpg\"/><img alt=\"五年規劃政策有延續性。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9c3067f6fbf57851ff24a8cb2000ab0a/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260916_144629255_22_0.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a8581f0f1b0840b3f682c369632f05b8/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260916_144629255_28_0.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7edde411c0c4ec8617ac7d8797409ed1/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260916_155711525_03_0.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/84e163038e343dd60ee202598eb22652/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260916_155711525_15.jpg\"/><p>【10:33】李家超指，香港首個五年規劃出台，標誌香港邁入更宏觀的謀劃，具有里程碑意義，香港可充分發揮國家機遇、國際機遇中的獨特優勢。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-17T02:42:04.900229+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":230,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}